{UTF-8}
Students= INTEG (
	Enrolment-Graduation,
		400)
	~	Students
	~	A pipeline stock (Vensim's pattern, as in the SDXorg Population sample): the students enrolled are in the stock until they graduate, a third-order delay of their enrolment (written for SD Lab).
	|
Enrolment=
	100+30*SIN(2*3.14159265358979*Time/50)+40*PULSE TRAIN(30, 60, 200, 1e+09)
	~	Students/Year
	~	A measured input: a seasonal intake and a larger cohort for 60 years in every 200.
	|
Graduation=
	DELAY3(Enrolment, Study Time)
	~	Students/Year
	~	Those enrolled leave the stock a third-order delay later: the delay's contents are the stock itself.
	|
Study Time=
	4
	~	Year
	~	
	|
********************************************************
	.Control
********************************************************~
		Simulation Control Parameters
	|
FINAL TIME  = 100
	~	Year
	~		|
INITIAL TIME  = 0
	~	Year
	~		|
SAVEPER  = 
        TIME STEP
	~	Year
	~		|
TIME STEP  = 1
	~	Year
	~		|
